Added orchestrator/bench_local30_gen.py to the chat (read-only).

bench_local30_gen.py generates answers to a set of 30 hard queries using the    
Qwen3-Coder-30B model run locally via Ollama. It:                               

 1 Loads a predefined set of 30 hard queries (HARD_QUERY_SET)                   
 2 For each query, sends it to a local Ollama instance running the specified    
   model                                                                        
 3 Saves results incrementally to a JSON file                                   
   (eval_candidates_local30_hard.json)                                          
 4 Supports resuming from partial results if interrupted                        
 5 Includes a demo mode for offline testing without Ollama                      

The script is designed to be run locally with an Ollama server already running  
and the required model pulled, making it cost-free to execute.                  

